{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不只想靠近、被同样珍惜，也想把积攒的关心给对方，看看两个人能过上怎样的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"被同样珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再为想被珍惜自责，欢喜把他整个卷进去，旧日难堪暂时退下，连自己的得失也顾不上。\",\n      \"key\": \"旧日难堪\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得有许多爱可给，许多真情值得珍惜，一时像是想要的都已经有了。可对方没给新保证，他仍盼对方选择自己。\",\n      \"key\": \"没给新保证\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时顾不上以后，只想让这阵欢喜多留一会儿，等它稍退，尚未得到回应的期待又回到心里。\",\n      \"key\": \"欢喜多留一会儿\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\", \"R52\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留坦然承认渴望后更清楚自己想要什么的走向，具体写出想靠近、被同样珍惜、给予关心和共同生活的愿望，去掉抽象的温柔有归处。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R53\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留愿望仍在但难堪暂时退下的意思，具体写出他不再为想被珍惜自责，欢喜使他暂时顾不上自己的得失，也解释了自我为何退到后面。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"补回他觉得自己有许多爱可给、许多真情值得珍惜的正面丰盈，避免重复宣告满足到极点；同时保留对方没有新保证、他仍盼对方选择自己的限制，说明内在饱满不等于愿望已经得到回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并承接后文\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他暂时顾不上未来、想让欢喜多留一会儿的心理，并写出欢喜稍退后未获回应的期待又回来，为下一段幸福仍在却出现缺憾留出前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ffe506f5-e1d6-460d-bfac-ae29c6f9447d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223743374034Z", "elapsed_seconds": 296.219, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:42:39.600576+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "39cfcb5321085f3a3b7e68bc7e1bc28316364fed9c7439219546dd867570c566", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223743374034Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "38b4d3bbcee9f9f30823b3040879e1f681ef4628bb7af4288b9